    adds explicit session evidence and preventing inherited secrets from
    becoming reachable through model-driven host tools;
  - create stdout with `mktemp` in `$ETUDE_OUTPUT_FILE`'s directory, require
    content beyond ASCII whitespace, reject any line containing the exact OAuth
    token using shell in-process matching, and rename it to
    `$ETUDE_OUTPUT_FILE` only on exit 0; never print the environment or token.
